 ## Overview
 Compliance audits are executed prior to every minor and major release.
 
+## Covered Engine Modules
+As mandated by GOVERNANCE.md for complete audit scope, the test suite tracks all designated core engines:
+- `parser`: Syntax parsing and AST generation.
+- `compiler`: IR transformation and code emission.
+- `bundler`: Asset packaging and module linking.
+
+Each listed component must achieve 100 percent branch coverage during
+audit execution.
+
 ## Verification Procedures
 1. Run `./scripts/run_checks.sh` in the repository root.
 2. Verify all test reports are archived in `build/reports/`.
 3. Submit verification artifacts to the release maintainer.
+
+## Reporting Schedule
+Audit logs are retained in `build/reports/audit.json` for 90 days following
+a tagged release.
